{"id":"b1721f50aceb744e","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-class-quotient-collapse.md","title":"Scott Class Quotients and Membership Collapse","display":"df-class-quotient-collapse — Scott Class Quotients and Membership Collapse","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-class-quotient-collapse","aliases":["58-df-class-quotient-collapse"],"display":"df-class-quotient-collapse — Scott Class Quotients and Membership Collapse","depends_on":["[[58-df-class-embedding-data.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-rank.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-class-quotient-collapse"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-class-quotient-collapse</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-class-quotient-collapse — Scott Class Quotients and Membership Collapse"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5578254565969219\" href=\"?note=5578254565969219\" title=\"58-df-class-embedding-data.md\">58-df-class-embedding-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"39b5d097687ec105\" href=\"?note=39b5d097687ec105\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-rank.md\">../batch10/58-df-rank.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md\">../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,Q,A,B,R_0,R_1,R,N,\\pi\">\\(D,Q,A,B,R_0,R_1,R,N,\\pi\\)</span> 为元素均为集合的元语言类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,e,f,x,y,q,r,z,a,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(d,e,f,x,y,q,r,z,a,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\alpha,\\operatorname{rank}\">\\(V_\\alpha,\\operatorname{rank}\\)</span> 按依赖文件。类关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"dR_0e\">\\(dR_0e\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle d,e\\rangle\\in R_0\">\\(\\langle d,e\\rangle\\in R_0\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[d]^{\\mathrm{Sc}}_{D,R_0}\">\\([d]^{\\mathrm{Sc}}_{D,R_0}\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in D\">\\(d\\in D\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_0\">\\(R_0\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 上等价关系时使用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ScQ}(D,R_0)\">\\(\\operatorname{ScQ}(D,R_0)\\)</span> 为类，不断言它是集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi(q)\">\\(\\pi(q)\\)</span> 的使用范围为下式类函数谓词成立时；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi[A]\">\\(\\pi[A]\\)</span> 表示逐元素像类。所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}\">\\(\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}\\)</span> 量词均在元语言中读取。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassFunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassFunction}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5578254565969219\" href=\"?note=5578254565969219\" title=\"58-df-class-embedding-data.md\">58-df-class-embedding-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassCollapse}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassCollapse}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassEquivalence}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassEquivalence}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassQuotientCollapse}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassQuotientCollapse}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WellFoundedMembership}\">\\(\\mathrm{WellFoundedMembership}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{meta}\">\\(\\mathrm{meta}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassEquivalence}_{58}(R_0,D)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;R_0\\subseteq D\\times D\n\\land(\\forall d\\in D\\;dR_0d)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall d,e\\in D\\;(dR_0e\\to eR_0d))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall d,e,f\\in D\\;((dR_0e\\land eR_0f)\\to dR_0f).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassEquivalence}_{58}(R_0,D)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;R_0\\subseteq D\\times D\n\\land(\\forall d\\in D\\;dR_0d)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall d,e\\in D\\;(dR_0e\\to eR_0d))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall d,e,f\\in D\\;((dR_0e\\land eR_0f)\\to dR_0f).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassEquivalence}_{58}(R_0,D)\\land d\\in D\\ \\to\\quad\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}\nr_{D,R_0}(d)&amp;\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\operatorname{rank}(e):e\\in D\\land dR_0e\\},\\\\\n[d]^{\\mathrm{Sc}}_{D,R_0}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{e\\in V_{r_{D,R_0}(d)+1}:e\\in D\\land dR_0e\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\right.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassEquivalence}_{58}(R_0,D)\\land d\\in D\\ \\to\\quad\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}\nr_{D,R_0}(d)&amp;\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\operatorname{rank}(e):e\\in D\\land dR_0e\\},\\\\\n[d]^{\\mathrm{Sc}}_{D,R_0}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{e\\in V_{r_{D,R_0}(d)+1}:e\\in D\\land dR_0e\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\right.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassEquivalence}_{58}(R_0,D)\\ \\to\\quad\n\\operatorname{ScQ}(D,R_0)\\coloneqq\\{q\\in V:\\exists d\\in D\\;(q=[d]^{\\mathrm{Sc}}_{D,R_0})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ClassEquivalence}_{58}(R_0,D)\\ \\to\\quad\n\\operatorname{ScQ}(D,R_0)\\coloneqq\\{q\\in V:\\exists d\\in D\\;(q=[d]^{\\mathrm{Sc}}_{D,R_0})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassCollapse}_{58}(\\pi,N,Q,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nR\\subseteq Q\\times Q\\land\\mathrm{ClassFunction}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\pi,Q,N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall x,y\\in Q\\;(\\pi(x)=\\pi(y)\\to x=y))\n\\land(\\forall z\\in N\\;\\exists x\\in Q\\;(z=\\pi(x)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(N)\n\\land\\forall x\\in Q\\;\\forall z\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(z\\in\\pi(x)\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in Q\\;(yRx\\land z=\\pi(y))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassCollapse}_{58}(\\pi,N,Q,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nR\\subseteq Q\\times Q\\land\\mathrm{ClassFunction}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\pi,Q,N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall x,y\\in Q\\;(\\pi(x)=\\pi(y)\\to x=y))\n\\land(\\forall z\\in N\\;\\exists x\\in Q\\;(z=\\pi(x)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(N)\n\\land\\forall x\\in Q\\;\\forall z\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(z\\in\\pi(x)\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in Q\\;(yRx\\land z=\\pi(y))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassQuotientCollapse}_{58}(\\pi,N,D,R_0,R_1)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ClassEquivalence}_{58}(R_0,D)\\land R_1\\subseteq D\\times D\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall d,d&#39;,e,e&#39;\\in D\\;\n((dR_0d&#39;\\land eR_0e&#39;)\\to(dR_1e\\leftrightarrow d&#39;R_1e&#39;))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ClassCollapse}_{58}\\bigl(\\pi,N,\\operatorname{ScQ}(D,R_0),\n\\{\\langle[d]^{\\mathrm{Sc}}_{D,R_0},[e]^{\\mathrm{Sc}}_{D,R_0}\\rangle:d,e\\in D\\land dR_1e\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassQuotientCollapse}_{58}(\\pi,N,D,R_0,R_1)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ClassEquivalence}_{58}(R_0,D)\\land R_1\\subseteq D\\times D\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall d,d&#39;,e,e&#39;\\in D\\;\n((dR_0d&#39;\\land eR_0e&#39;)\\to(dR_1e\\leftrightarrow d&#39;R_1e&#39;))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ClassCollapse}_{58}\\bigl(\\pi,N,\\operatorname{ScQ}(D,R_0),\n\\{\\langle[d]^{\\mathrm{Sc}}_{D,R_0},[e]^{\\mathrm{Sc}}_{D,R_0}\\rangle:d,e\\in D\\land dR_1e\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WellFoundedMembership}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\varnothing\\ne a\\subseteq N\\to\\exists x\\in a\\;(x\\cap a=\\varnothing)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{WellFoundedMembership}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\varnothing\\ne a\\subseteq N\\to\\exists x\\in a\\;(x\\cap a=\\varnothing)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Scott 代表是同一等价类中秩最小的全部代表组成的集合，不使用真类作为商结构的元素。坍缩由逐元素递归等式给出；只有存在这样的坍缩时，后续 ultrapower 偏算子才有值。该定义没有把良基性或坍缩本身当作未展开的标准接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-class-embedding-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"5578254565969219","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-class-embedding-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-rank.md","status"